/T (Section 35. Penal Provision. - The following shall be punished by a fine of not less than One hundred thousand pesos \(P100,000.00\) nor more than One million pesos \(P1,000,000.00\), or by imprisonment of not less than six \(6\) months nor more than six \(6\) years, or both, in the discretion of the court:)
/E (Section 35. Penal Provision. - The following shall be punished by a fine of not less than One hundred thousand pesos \(P100,000.00\) nor more than One million pesos \(P1,000,000.00\), or by imprisonment of not less than six \(6\) months nor more than six \(6\) years, or both, in the discretion of the court:)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
